Material copied from other repositories of the same author:

- imported/fabricmap/ and imported/psmap/ hold files copied unchanged from
  zynq-fabricmap and zynq-psmap (both Apache-2.0). Each directory has an
  IMPORT.json that records the source repository, path, commit and sha256 of
  every file.

Generated artifacts and referenced tools:

- Tracked .bit files are exact reproducibility artifacts generated with
  AMD/Xilinx Vivado from the designs in pl/ and imported/. Vivado itself is
  proprietary software and is not redistributed in this repository.
- AMD/Xilinx user guides, including UG470, UG585 and UG908, are cited as
  references only and are not redistributed here.
- The Project X-Ray database (prjxray-db) is not in this repository. The
  grading programs read it from a separate checkout, after the fact.
